Description: XDG Desktop Portal backend for Hyprland
 This package provides an XDG Desktop Portal backend for Hyprland.
 It is a program that lets other applications communicate swiftly with
 the compositor through D-Bus.
 .
 You do not have to use xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland. Hyprland will work
 with xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, but xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland has
 more features, such as window sharing.
 .
 On the other hand, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland will work on other
 wlroots-based compositors, although limited to the xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
 features (other will be disabled).
